{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "ParserBee API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "ParserBee API allows you to extract structured data from documents (PDFs, images, Word, PowerPoint, Excel, and more) using custom templates.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### 1. Create an Account\nSign up at [app.parserbee.com](https://app.parserbee.com/create-account) and verify your email address.\n\n### 2. Generate an API Key\n1. Log in to your [dashboard](https://app.parserbee.com/dashboard)\n2. Go to **Settings** from the sidebar\n3. Click **Generate API Key**\n4. Copy and securely store your API key (it starts with `pk_`)\n\n> **Important:** You can view your API key anytime from Settings. If you need to regenerate it, click **Regenerate API Key**, but note that the old key will be invalidated.\n\n### 3. Make Your First API Call\nUse your API key in the `x-api-key` header with every request:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://app.parserbee.com/api/v1/extract \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: pk_your_api_key_here\" \\\n  -F \"template_id=your_template_id\" \\\n  -F \"file=@invoice.pdf\"\n```\n\n## Authentication\nAll API endpoints require authentication via the `x-api-key` header. You can generate and manage your API key from the **Settings** page in your dashboard.\n\n## Rate Limits & Page Credits\nEach extraction costs **1 page credit per page processed**, with a minimum of 1. A single image or one-page document costs 1 page credit; a 10-page PDF costs 10. The exact count is returned in the response as `usage.pages_processed` and `usage.credits_charged`. Your page credit balance depends on your subscription plan. You can check your remaining page credits via the `/api/v1/credits` endpoint or from the dashboard.\n\n## Supported File Types\n\n**Documents**\n- PDF (`application/pdf`)\n- Word (`.doc`)\n- PowerPoint (`.pptx`, `.ppt`)\n- Excel (`.xlsx`)\n- OpenDocument Text (`.odt`)\n- Rich Text (`.rtf`)\n- Plain text (`.txt`)\n- CSV (`.csv`)\n- HTML (`.html`, `.htm`)\n- Email (`.eml`)\n\n**Images**\n- PNG (`image/png`)\n- JPEG (`image/jpeg`, `image/jpg`)\n- WebP (`image/webp`)\n- HEIC/HEIF (`image/heic`, `image/heif`)\n\nNot supported: Word (`.docx`), legacy Excel (`.xls`), OpenDocument Spreadsheet (`.ods`), and OpenDocument Presentation (`.odp`). Save a `.docx` as PDF before uploading.\n\nMaximum file size: **50 MB**",
    "contact": {
      "name": "ParserBee Support",
      "email": "support@parserbee.com",
      "url": "https://parserbee.com"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://app.parserbee.com",
      "description": "Production server"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "ApiKeyAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Extract",
      "description": "Document extraction endpoints"
    },
    {
      "name": "Credits",
      "description": "Page credit balance and usage"
    },
    {
      "name": "Activity",
      "description": "Extraction activity and history"
    },
    {
      "name": "Templates",
      "description": "Extraction templates"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/extract": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Extract"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract data from a document",
        "description": "Upload a document (PDF, image, Word, PowerPoint, Excel, CSV, TXT, RTF, ODT, HTML, or EML) and extract structured data using a template. Each extraction costs **1 page credit per page processed** (minimum 1).\n\nThe template defines the fields to extract. You must create a template first from the dashboard before using this endpoint.\n\n**Note:** You can provide either a `file` (upload) or `file_url` (URL to document). At least one is required.",
        "operationId": "extractDocument",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "template_id"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "file_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "description": "URL to the document file. Must be a publicly accessible URL. Supported formats: PDF, PNG, JPEG, WebP, HEIC, DOC, PPTX, PPT, XLSX, CSV, TXT, RTF, ODT, HTML, EML. Either `file` or `file_url` is required.",
                    "example": "https://example.com/invoice.pdf"
                  },
                  "template_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "The ID of the template to use for extraction. Get template IDs from the `/api/v1/templates` endpoint or from the dashboard.",
                    "example": "abc123def456"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "template_id"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "file": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary",
                    "description": "The document file to extract data from. Supported formats: PDF, PNG, JPEG, WebP. Max size: 50MB. Either `file` or `file_url` is required."
                  },
                  "file_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "description": "URL to the document file. Must be a publicly accessible URL. Supported formats: PDF, PNG, JPEG, WebP, HEIC, DOC, PPTX, PPT, XLSX, CSV, TXT, RTF, ODT, HTML, EML. Either `file` or `file_url` is required.",
                    "example": "https://example.com/invoice.pdf"
                  },
                  "template_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "The ID of the template to use for extraction. Get template IDs from the `/api/v1/templates` endpoint or from the dashboard.",
                    "example": "abc123def456"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Extraction successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "example": true
                    },
                    "request_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": "req_abc123"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "Extracted data matching the template fields",
                      "example": {
                        "invoice_number": "INV-2026-001",
                        "total_amount": 1500,
                        "vendor_name": "Acme Corp"
                      }
                    },
                    "credits_remaining": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "example": 449
                    },
                    "processing_time_ms": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "example": 2400
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "pages_processed": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Number of pages parsed in this document",
                          "example": 1
                        },
                        "credits_charged": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Page credits deducted for this extraction (1 per page processed, minimum 1)",
                          "example": 1
                        },
                        "doc_size_bytes": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "example": 204800
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad request: missing file, invalid file type, or missing template_id",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "missingFile": {
                    "summary": "Missing file",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "File is required",
                      "code": "MISSING_FILE"
                    }
                  },
                  "missingTemplate": {
                    "summary": "Missing template_id",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "template_id is required",
                      "code": "MISSING_TEMPLATE_ID"
                    }
                  },
                  "invalidFile": {
                    "summary": "Invalid file type or size",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "Invalid file. Must be a supported document or image format, max 50MB",
                      "code": "INVALID_FILE"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized: invalid or missing API key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Invalid API key",
                  "code": "INVALID_API_KEY"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "Payment required: insufficient page credits",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Insufficient page credits. Please upgrade your plan to get more page credits.",
                  "code": "INSUFFICIENT_CREDITS",
                  "credits_remaining": 0
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden: no active subscription, or the account is locked (code ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "No active subscription. Please subscribe to use this API.",
                  "code": "SUBSCRIPTION_INACTIVE"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found: template not found or not owned by user",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Template not found or you don't have access to it",
                  "code": "TEMPLATE_NOT_FOUND"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Server error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to process document",
                  "code": "PROCESSING_FAILED"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/credits": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Credits"
        ],
        "summary": "View remaining page credits",
        "description": "Returns your current page credit balance, subscription plan, and billing period information.",
        "operationId": "getCredits",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Page credit information retrieved successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "credits_remaining": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Number of page credits remaining",
                      "example": 450
                    },
                    "credits_total": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Total page credits for the billing period",
                      "example": 500
                    },
                    "subscription_plan": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "trial",
                        "starter",
                        "scale",
                        "business"
                      ],
                      "example": "starter"
                    },
                    "subscription_status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "trial",
                        "active",
                        "canceled",
                        "past_due",
                        "incomplete",
                        "suspended"
                      ],
                      "example": "active"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized: invalid or missing API key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden: no active subscription, or the account is locked (code ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/activity": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Activity"
        ],
        "summary": "View recent activity",
        "description": "Returns the last 10 document extraction requests, ordered by most recent first.",
        "operationId": "getActivity",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Activity list retrieved successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "items": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActivitySummary"
                      }
                    },
                    "total": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Total number of items returned",
                      "example": 10
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized: invalid or missing API key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden: no active subscription, or the account is locked (code ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/activity/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Activity"
        ],
        "summary": "View activity details",
        "description": "Returns full details of a specific extraction request, including the extracted data.",
        "operationId": "getActivityById",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "The activity/request ID",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "abc123def456"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Activity details retrieved successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActivityDetail"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized: invalid or missing API key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden: no active subscription, or the account is locked (code ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found: activity record not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/templates": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Templates"
        ],
        "summary": "List all templates",
        "description": "Returns all extraction templates owned by the authenticated user.",
        "operationId": "getTemplates",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Templates list retrieved successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "items": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Template"
                      }
                    },
                    "total": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Total number of templates",
                      "example": 3
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized: invalid or missing API key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden: no active subscription, or the account is locked (code ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/templates/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Templates"
        ],
        "summary": "View template details",
        "description": "Returns details of a specific template. The template must belong to the authenticated user.",
        "operationId": "getTemplateById",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "The template ID",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "tpl_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Template details retrieved successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Template"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized: invalid or missing API key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden: no active subscription, or the account is locked (code ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found: template not found or not owned by user",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "ApiKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "x-api-key",
        "description": "Your ParserBee API key. Generate one from **Settings** in your dashboard. The key starts with `pk_`."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Human-readable error message"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Machine-readable error code"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "error",
          "code"
        ]
      },
      "ActivitySummary": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique request ID",
            "example": "abc123def456"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "success",
              "failed"
            ],
            "example": "success"
          },
          "file_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the uploaded file",
            "example": "invoice.pdf"
          },
          "file_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "MIME type of the file",
            "example": "application/pdf"
          },
          "file_size": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "File size in bytes",
            "example": 204800
          },
          "template": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Template ID used for extraction",
            "example": "tpl_xyz789"
          },
          "processing_time_ms": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Processing time in milliseconds",
            "example": 2400
          },
          "created": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "When the request was created"
          }
        }
      },
      "ActivityDetail": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique request ID",
            "example": "abc123def456"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "success",
              "failed"
            ],
            "example": "success"
          },
          "file_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "invoice.pdf"
          },
          "file_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "application/pdf"
          },
          "file_size": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 204800
          },
          "template": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "tpl_xyz789"
          },
          "processing_time_ms": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 2400
          },
          "extracted_data": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "The structured data extracted from the document",
            "example": {
              "invoice_number": "INV-2026-001",
              "total_amount": 1500,
              "vendor_name": "Acme Corp"
            }
          },
          "api_key_used": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Last 8 characters of the API key used",
            "example": "****pk_x"
          },
          "created": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updated": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "Template": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique template ID",
            "example": "tpl_abc123"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Template name",
            "example": "Invoice Template"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Template description",
            "example": "Extract invoice data fields"
          },
          "fields": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "List of fields to extract",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "invoice_number"
                },
                "title": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Invoice Number"
                },
                "type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "string",
                    "number",
                    "boolean",
                    "object",
                    "array"
                  ],
                  "example": "string"
                },
                "nullable": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "example": false
                },
                "required": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "example": true
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "created": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updated": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
